# WDS build / package environment template
#
# Usage (pick one):
#   1) cp scripts/env.example scripts/env.local   # then edit; auto-loaded by scripts
#   2) export WDS_ENV_FILE=/path/to/your.env
#   3) export the variables in your shell / CI before calling scripts
#
# Do NOT commit env.local — it may contain machine-specific absolute paths.

# --- Windows cross-compile (typical Linux host → win-x86_64) ---------------

# Preferred: point at a vcpkg checkout; prefix/library paths are derived.
# WDS_VCPKG_ROOT="$HOME/src/vcpkg"
# WDS_VCPKG_TRIPLET="x64-mingw-static"

# Or set the CMake prefix / Vulkan import lib explicitly (absolute paths OK locally):
# WDS_CMAKE_PREFIX_PATH="/path/to/vcpkg/installed/x64-mingw-static"
# WDS_VULKAN_LIBRARY="/path/to/vcpkg/installed/x64-mingw-static/lib/libvulkan-1.dll.a"

# MinGW tool names (override if your distro uses different prefixes)
# WDS_MINGW_TRIPLE="x86_64-w64-mingw32"
# WDS_MINGW_CXX="x86_64-w64-mingw32-g++"
# WDS_MINGW_OBJDUMP="x86_64-w64-mingw32-objdump"

# Extra directories to search for MinGW runtime DLLs when packaging
# (colon-separated). Leave empty to auto-discover from the compiler.
# WDS_MINGW_DLL_DIRS="/usr/lib/gcc/x86_64-w64-mingw32/13-posix:/usr/x86_64-w64-mingw32/lib"

# --- Windows MSI packaging (msitools / wixl on the Linux host) --------------

# WDS_MSITOOLS_PREFIX="$HOME/.local/opt/msitools"
# Directory under the prefix that holds libmsi (multiarch name varies by host):
# WDS_MSITOOLS_LIB_DIR="$HOME/.local/opt/msitools/usr/lib/x86_64-linux-gnu"
# WDS_WIXL_VERSION="0.103"
# Colon-separated share dirs to probe for wixl includes:
# WDS_WIXL_SHARE_DIRS="/usr/share/wixl-0.103:/usr/local/share/wixl-0.103"
# WDS_PRODUCT_VERSION="1.0.0"

# Optional LunarG mirror for the vulkan-1.dll components zip (not an installer):
# WDS_VULKAN_COMPONENTS_URL="https://sdk.lunarg.com/sdk/download/latest/windows/vulkan-runtime-components.zip?Human=true"

# --- macOS native (macos-arm) ----------------------------------------------

# Usually auto-detected via `brew --prefix`. Override if needed:
# CMAKE_PREFIX_PATH="/opt/homebrew"
# VULKAN_SDK="$HOME/VulkanSDK/<version>/macOS"

# --- Shared ----------------------------------------------------------------

# WDS_RUNTIME_CACHE="$PWD/.cache/runtime"
# CMAKE_BUILD_PARALLEL_LEVEL="8"
